# The decoders the CPU's producers read (`seismic_lang::producers`): the one
# statement of reach, which form admission reads. The CPU's library is Rust
# and reads admission itself (`forms::cpu_int8_of`), so the build renders
# nothing from this declaration (seismic/lang/build.rs renders the C++ and
# GLSL libraries' predicates alone).

# The quantized dot reads the codes of every packed-rows decode
# (`weights::Codes`); its dense rows (`weights::DenseRows`) are no packed
# weight's.
form INT8
codes=*
